-- Vary the "Who's right?" endings so they don't all read the same (Alex, Nov 22 2026). Source: scripts/launch-battles.data.ts.
UPDATE "battle" b SET "title" = v.t, "updated_at" = now()
FROM (VALUES
  ('seed_vb_1', 'My husband turns on subtitles for EVERYTHING. Even stuff in English. Who''s right?'),
  ('seed_vb_2', 'He says if I make dinner, packing his lunch for tomorrow is ''basically the same thing''. Who is right?'),
  ('seed_vb_3', 'I spent $400 on Taylor tickets without asking first. My fiancé is LIVID. Who''s right here?'),
  ('seed_vb_4', 'I told my mom we''re pregnant before 12 weeks. He''s furious. So who''s right?'),
  ('seed_vb_5', 'She went through my phone while I was asleep. Found nothing. Now I''m the one who''s upset. Which one of us is right?'),
  ('seed_vb_6', 'Party invite says 7pm. My wife wants to leave the house at 6:45. I say show up 7:30. Ok who''s right?'),
  ('seed_vb_7', 'I cooked a full dinner. He thinks whoever''s ''less tired'' does the dishes. I think the cook never cleans. Who''s right??'),
  ('seed_vb_8', 'My bf keeps the thermostat at 74 and I''m sweating in my own apartment. I want 68. Who''s actually right?'),
  ('seed_vb_9', 'He sat in the car scrolling for 20 min after getting home instead of coming inside to help with the kids. Who''s right?'),
  ('seed_vb_10', 'My wife wants to split the honeymoon 50/50 even though I make 3x what she makes. Who is right?'),
  ('seed_vb_11', 'I took ONE sip of his iced mocha while pregnant and he made it a whole thing. Who''s right here?'),
  ('seed_vb_12', 'My boyfriend wants his gaming setup in OUR bedroom. RGB lights all night. I want it out. So who''s right?'),
  ('seed_vb_13', 'My husband told his whole friend group about our fertility struggles without asking me. Which one of us is right?'),
  ('seed_vb_14', 'I want separate blankets in bed (the Scandinavian way). He thinks it means we''re drifting apart. Ok who''s right?'),
  ('seed_vb_15', 'He goes to the gym 6am every day and leaves me with the morning chaos. Who''s right??'),
  ('seed_vb_16', 'My girlfriend says I should''ve defended her when my mom made a comment about her weight. I froze. Who''s actually right?'),
  ('seed_vb_17', 'My husband invited his brother to stay with us for ''a couple weeks''. It''s been 3 months. Who''s right?'),
  ('seed_vb_19', 'I left the dishwasher running while we were out. He says that''s a fire hazard and dangerous. Who is right?'),
  ('seed_vb_20', 'She wants to spend every holiday at her parents'' because ''my family is more fun''. Who''s right here?'),
  ('seed_vb_21', 'My husband says I can''t go on my best friend''s 30th in Vegas. Every other place is fine. So who''s right?'),
  ('seed_vb_22', 'He wants to use our wedding gift money on a new truck. I want it in savings. Which one of us is right?'),
  ('seed_vb_24', 'I want to keep my last name when we get married. He says it means I''m not fully committed. Ok who''s right?'),
  ('seed_vb_26', 'My boyfriend of 8 months keeps asking my ''body count''. I don''t want to tell him. Who''s right??'),
  ('seed_vb_27', 'He wants a dog. I said no. He brought one home anyway ''to foster''. Who''s actually right?'),
  ('seed_vb_29', 'Found screenshots of our fights in my wife''s group chat with her sisters. Who''s right?'),
  ('seed_vb_30', 'I want to sleep train our baby. My husband can''t handle the crying and keeps going in. Who is right?'),
  ('seed_vb_32', 'I asked my husband to get the kids ready while I showered. He said he was ''babysitting''. Who''s right here?'),
  ('seed_vb_33', 'My husband says I spend too much on skincare. He spends more on golf. So who''s right?'),
  ('seed_vb_35', 'He took a job in another state without telling me until AFTER he accepted. We''ve been married 4 years. Which one of us is right?'),
  ('seed_vb_36', 'My wife won''t let me go to my buddy''s bachelor party because there will be strippers. Ok who''s right?'),
  ('seed_vb_37', 'Our toddler threw a tantrum at Target and my husband just walked away to ''let me handle it''. Who''s right??'),
  ('seed_vb_39', 'My girlfriend says it''s a red flag that I''ve never posted her on Instagram. We''ve been together a year. Who''s actually right?'),
  ('seed_vb_40', 'He forgot our anniversary but says ''every day with you is our anniversary''. Who''s right?'),
  ('seed_vb_164', 'I don''t play pretend with my kids. I let them play alone. My MIL says I''m a bad mom. Who is right?'),
  ('seed_vb_178', 'My mom still tips 15% at restaurants and thinks I''m crazy for doing 20%. Who''s right here?'),
  ('seed_vb_179', 'My husband tips on the total after tax, I tip before. We argue every single time. So who''s right?')
) AS v(id, t)
WHERE b.id = v.id;
